      "description": "Audience-ready content writing specialist for blog posts, product copy, newsletters, documentation, social media, and press releases. Writes from a brief or evidence base — not from speculation.",
      "capabilities": ["blog post writing", "product copy", "newsletter writing", "documentation writing", "social media copy", "press release drafting", "brand tone adaptation", "seo-friendly writing"],
